WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:23.580
Public Program
Cairns, Australia

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.550
March 9, 1990

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:34.480
I bow to all the seekers of truth.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:49.850
At the very outset, we have to understand
that truth is what it is.

00:00:49.850 --> 00:01:01.420
We cannot organize it, order it, or conceptualize
it.

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:09.430
It has been, it is and it will be.

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:18.439
And we cannot know it through our human awareness,
through our mental capacities, emotional projections,

00:01:18.439 --> 00:01:22.290
imaginary thinking.

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:30.840
It has to be perceived, and to be experienced
on our central nervous system.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:43.810
As in our evolution we have grown, slowly
developing into human state, also we have

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:50.200
to grow a little more to become the spirit
state.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:02:02.560
When I am talking to you about this mechanism,
which is a subtle mechanism within us, you

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:13.350
have to have the attitude of a scientist who
has an open mind, and to accept whatever I

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:17.210
am saying as a hypothesis.

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:25.370
And then if it is proved, as honest people
you have to accept it, because this is for

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:37.970
our benevolence, benevolence of our countrymen,
emancipation of the whole humanity; because

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:46.430
within us is placed this subtle mechanism.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:55.730
This time is so special, I feel, because there
are so many seekers of truth.

00:02:55.730 --> 00:03:03.090
Before this, people used to run after so many
other things.

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:09.599
First, for the security they had all kinds
of clubs and all kinds of arrangements made

00:03:09.599 --> 00:03:18.959
that you should feel secured from nature,
from natural crisis, from animals; and then

00:03:18.959 --> 00:03:36.430
they developed other organizations just to
feel their power and their money-orientation.

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:43.530
Now the time has come for us to see that all
these things do not lead us to a very happy

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.530
life.

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:52.120
We have so many problems, so many tensions,
and so many diseases endless – and very

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:55.420
new type of incurable diseases that have come
in.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:04:01.360
I don’t know how far Stephen has told you
about the centers, but all these six centers

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:07.650
that are pierced through, through this power
which is within us: this is the power of pure

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.980
desire.

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:14.120
So far, whatever desires we had are not pure.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:18.910
If they were, we would have felt satisfied
about them.

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:34.560
But as you know, economics says that the 
desires are not satiable in general.

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:38.560
Wants are not satiable in general – means
you want something today, then you want something

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:41.590
tomorrow, then you want something later on.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:47.840
If you get something, then you do not enjoy
that for which you were hankering, then you

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:49.550
want to have something else.

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:58.639
That shows this is not pure desire, but a
desire which leads you to another desire.

00:04:58.639 --> 00:05:09.740
So this is the power of pure desire lying
within you, and she is your mother: your own

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:13.580
mother, an individual mother, reflected within
you.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:19.130
We can say this is the Holy Ghost reflected
in you.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:24.060
We have very mysterious ideas about Holy Ghost
– is not that mysterious.

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:37.370
There’s God Almighty as the Father, then
we have Son, the God, and what about the Trinity

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:42.380
is that the third one is a Holy Ghost.

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:47.039
That has to be the Primordial Mother – has
to be, logically.

00:05:47.039 --> 00:05:54.509
But somehow people avoided talking of women,
and they didn’t want to show that the mother

00:05:54.509 --> 00:05:58.100
is such an important thing.

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:07.550
Not in all the religions: like in Hinduism
or, say, in Buddhism, every religion, they

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:16.190
worshipped Mother as the creator of the whole
universe, and that God Almighty is just the

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:17.190
witness.

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:23.139
Also you can see Christ, how He emphasized,
that when He was dying on the cross said,

00:06:23.139 --> 00:06:25.350
“Behold the Mother.”

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:32.020
So this Primordial Mother is the mother which
is within us reflected as the kundalini.

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:38.550
And when she rises, this kundalini, when she
rises and pierces through the fontanel bone

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:44.669
area, she gives you the actualization of baptism.

00:06:44.669 --> 00:06:50.060
You get connected with that subtle energy
which is surrounding us, about which everybody

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:54.259
has talked: even in Koran it’s called as
ruh.

00:06:54.259 --> 00:06:56.860
Kundalini is called as assas.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:07:02.220
In every scripture there’s a description
of a kundalini of some way or other, or of

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:08.180
this mechanism, as in the Bible is that there
is a Tree of Life within us.

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:10.919
Even in Gita is described a Tree of Life.

00:07:10.919 --> 00:07:18.569
So every religion has described this mechanism,
plus it has always said that you must seek

00:07:18.569 --> 00:07:23.400
yourself, that you should have your second
birth.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:30.060
But people just certified themselves as “we
are something born again” you can call it,

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:37.240
“we are brahmins” or they can call themselves
that “we are realized souls.”

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:40.180
But by false certificate you do not become.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.930
It’s a question of becoming.

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:49.900
You have to become; it’s not just giving
a false certificate about it that we are something

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:50.900
and they are something.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:57.990
It is so obvious and evident, you can see
it, that anybody follows any religion whatsoever

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:01.319
is capable of committing any sin.

00:08:01.319 --> 00:08:05.319
There’s no bondage of the religion that
they follow.

00:08:05.319 --> 00:08:10.800
That means it’s all outside, it’s not
innate within us; and the religion has to

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:12.330
be innate.

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:18.199
And I call it as the valency of human beings,
that human beings have ten valencies.

00:08:18.199 --> 00:08:23.419
And when this kundalini rises, she enlightens
those ten valencies in this area that you

00:08:23.419 --> 00:08:30.199
see – the green area, Void, you see – it
enlightens all that, and that’s how you

00:08:30.199 --> 00:08:32.229
just become a righteous person.

00:08:32.229 --> 00:08:42.110
You become righteous, you become virtuous
and you are proud of it, but you do not try

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:45.560
to aggress others with it.

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:55.690
You enjoy them, because you are so compassionate
that you want to be sharing it with others

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:57.370
and enjoying it with others.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:09:02.200
A new personality is evolved out of us.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:11.640
I always say, like a pond, sometimes we feel
that our lives have become so much full of

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:18.480
miseries and troubles, as in a pond we see
lots of creatures creeping around; but when

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:26.030
the lotus blooms out it fills the whole pond
and transforms it with the fragrance that

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:27.310
it has.

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:31.440
In the same way it happens to us, such a transformation.

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:36.940
First of all is the simple one, where physical
being improves, automatically – not by any

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:42.090
medicine, not by anything else, but your own
power.

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:44.560
It’s your own power that cures you.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:48.790
You don’t have to take any medicines for
it, you don’t have to pay for it because

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.320
it’s a living process, as I told you.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:57.320
So you don’t have to go to any doctor, you
just know the diagnosis yourself and you get

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.580
cured yourself.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:04.860
You can cure yourself, you can cure others,
because you are realized and you can give

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:07.600
realizations to others, so they get cured,
too.

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:13.700
Then the mental problems like schizophrenia
and all these things just disappear.

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:19.720
If there is tension, it is – he must have
told you about the ego and superego, because

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:20.920
they cover your head.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:29.500
But when it opens out, all your worries, all
your attentions pass out, and you become a

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:36.000
person who can be called as a person of thoughtless
awareness.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:43.070
Means you watch something: you don’t think
about it, you just see it – just seeing,

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:44.980
the witnessing part.

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:51.330
And that is the greatest thing that happens,
because if you want you can think, but if

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:54.720
you don’t want you don’t have to think,
you just have to watch.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:59.310
Now you see a beautiful carpet lying here.

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:04.690
Supposing I had possessed this carpet or supposing
I was of a normal type, I would have been

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:11.830
worried that is it insured or not and may
be spoilt, or something like that.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:14.460
And if it had belonged to somebody else I
would have been thinking, “Oh, how will

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:16.940
I purchase this, where can I get it?”

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:21.500
and all kinds of thoughts; but the beauty
of this carpet I’m not enjoying.

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:25.490
But once I have developed this witness state
I look at it.

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:33.990
And I look at it and what I see is the beauty,
because it acts on Me: the beauty, the creation,

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:39.290
the joy of that creation, everything acts
and I soothe down with that beauty completely,

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:45.070
as if there are rivers flowing on My head
of complete joy.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:50.060
And this is what we have to enjoy in this
new personality.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:56.180
Then one has to know that we are peace, because
spirit is the source of peace.

00:11:56.180 --> 00:12:00.790
Once you become the spirit, the spirit comes
into your attention and you become a very

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:02.430
peaceful person.

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:09.280
It’s like you are on the periphery, like
on the wheel: if you are on the periphery

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:13.730
you are moving all the time, but the center
of the wheel is absolutely peaceful.

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:19.240
So, as if you jump on to your center, from
there you’ll see all the movement of the

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:22.750
wheel, but you are in the center and you are
not disturbed.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:27.900
You can see the problems very easy to be handled.

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:34.150
We can give another analogy, that’s supposing
you are standing in the waves, then you are

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:39.500
afraid of the waves, that you might be drowned;
but supposing you get on to a boat then you

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:42.620
start seeing these waves.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:48.050
But supposing you know how to swim, then you
can jump in and save people who are getting

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:49.050
drowned.

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:53.180
In the same way, we are lost in the waves
of our thoughts.

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:59.730
But once we become the witness, we see our
problems much more clearly and that’s how

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:04.260
we know also the solutions, and things work
out.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:08.040
Above all, you become the joy.

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:16.191
You become the joy, a pure joy; not the joy
outwardly which has to be thought and is to

00:13:16.191 --> 00:13:19.519
be – see, you, some see paintings, they
say, “Oh, you must see this is this, this

00:13:19.519 --> 00:13:21.300
is … ” – nothing of the kind.

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:25.170
Nobody need tell you what is this painting
is about, you just see the painting and you

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:29.350
see it, and you get all the joy out of that
within you.

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:33.440
So you become a source of joy for everyone
else.

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:38.010
But the greatest thing that happens, that
you get connected to this all-pervading Power

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:48.680
– this Power that organizes everything,
that does all living work, that thinks for

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:59.620
us, is very gentle, and also can destroy whichever
is against construction.

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:02.960
It can destroy all evil things.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:06.140
And it loves you.

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:11.060
So you get connected to that energy, that
vital energy – it starts flowing through

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:23.520
you, so you do not feel tired, you are dynamic,
you are compassionate, at the same time at

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:25.640
peace with yourself.

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:30.940
That is the wonderful thing that we are; we
are made that way.

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:38.390
Only we have to know ourselves, like this
instrument has to go to the mains: in the

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:44.310
same way we have to be connected to the mains,
and that’s how we know what glorious things

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:46.140
we are.

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:52.020
Today is the only day I am here, I am sorry
I couldn’t spend more time.

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:58.560
But I hope to come back again sometime, maybe
in May, because I didn’t know there was

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:06.120
such a response here, and such nice people
living in this place who are so responsive

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.880
to truth.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:15.430
So I’m here with you and for a short time,
and in this short lecture I cannot tell you

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:20.320
all about it – it’s an ocean of knowledge
– but we have lots of tapes which you can

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:23.800
hear and understand Sahaja Yoga.

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:31.020
But in any case I would like you to ask Me
questions before we go in for this process

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:32.740
of Self-realization.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:44.180
That will take about ten minutes only.

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:49.240
The questions should be relevant because I
have come here to give you your own beauty.

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:56.310
I’ve not come here to ask for votes or anything
like that!

00:15:56.310 --> 00:16:04.680
So it should be relevant with the subject,
and should be helpful to you as well as to

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:10.150
Me to know what are the problems are.

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:35.140
[Question about possible damage from kundalini
awakening.]

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:39.090
Kundalini awakening never damages you.

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:46.730
But as far as the bad management is concerned,
a person who has no authority to raise kundalini

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:52.750
tries to do some nonsensical things, naturally
there is a damage because they have no authority,

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:56.110
divine authority, and they are doing the job.

00:16:56.110 --> 00:17:03.680
But so far there are so many Sahaja yogis
all over the world, and also the Sahaja yogis

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:06.360
have given realizations to people.

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:08.270
It doesn’t do damage.

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:10.150
It’s your mother.

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:15.539
And when you were born she took up all the
labor upon all herself, she took up all the

00:17:15.539 --> 00:17:19.949
pains upon herself and saw that you were not
hurt.

00:17:19.949 --> 00:17:24.970
In the same way this mother, she knows everything
about you, she’s the loving mother, the

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:36.050
most loving mother, and she is not going to
bother you at all.

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:41.490
Some people do write like that, that “kundalini
awakening is very difficult, it will do you

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.490
damage” and all that.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:47.370
It is only just, just to see that people don’t
get their realization: it’s just to frighten,

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:50.510
or maybe it’s a money-oriented nonsense.

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:53.910
Must be that they must be wanting to frighten
you that “you are sinful, you are useless,

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:59.270
you’d better give us money so that maybe
your kundalini might rise” or something.

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:04.743
I have seen some people who cannot get realization
or anything, they come and tell Me, “Mother,

00:18:04.743 --> 00:18:06.250
I must be very sinful person.”

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:07.450
I said, “Who told you that?”

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:09.030
“Certain guru has told me.”

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:13.260
I said, “You go and tell him back that ‘you
are the most sinful person ever born.’”

00:18:13.260 --> 00:18:18.980
So all these ideas are coming up on people
who are very simple-hearted and gullible,

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:24.860
because they believe all this nonsense and
they just succumb to it – but it’s not

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:25.860
so.

00:18:25.860 --> 00:18:34.440
I told you, you are glorious and beautiful;
please believe Me in that.

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:49.640
[Question: What chakra is related to integrity?

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:55.580
And how to work on that chakra to keep oneself
strong?]

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:56.580
Integrity?

00:18:56.580 --> 00:19:03.880
You see, integrity is not one particular chakra,
but it’s the experience.

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:11.370
What happens, you get the experience of realization,
so that you start feeling the cool breeze,

00:19:11.370 --> 00:19:17.870
the vibrations of the Holy Ghost, you can
say, or of the ruh surrounding you, and you

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:19.370
start enjoying it.

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:25.360
You just enjoy it, and you don’t want to
give it up.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:29.460
You don’t want to give it up, because you
enjoy it.

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:33.910
That’s how the integrity develops.

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:41.100
There is no stamping like that, that you have
to be integrated, or you have to be into the

00:19:41.100 --> 00:19:43.380
integrity – it’s not there.

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:50.260
But the integration does take place, because
all these chakras get a sort of a kundalini

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:55.630
inside them, which like a thread passes through
all these beautiful pearls.

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.790
So that’s integration is there.

00:19:57.790 --> 00:20:01.700
But integrity part comes through your own
depth, first of all.

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:06.370
If you touch your depth, you just never leave
Sahaja Yoga.

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:11.280
Some people do leave Sahaja Yoga because of
very superficial reasons sometimes, but again

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:12.280
they want to come back.

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:17.371
You see, the trouble is, they leave it and
then again come back, because it’s such

00:20:17.371 --> 00:20:21.620
a source of joy.

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:25.501
They are allowed to leave and they, sometimes
we have to ask some people to leave because

00:20:25.501 --> 00:20:31.720
they can be very destructive people – some
are very destructive people who come to Sahaja

00:20:31.720 --> 00:20:36.060
Yoga – but all of them then get cleared
out and come back again.

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:37.750
So it grows.

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:43.760
There’s no force, of anything.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:51.850
Like somebody told Me that she said that “I’ll
take fifty dollars for a course in Sahaj Yoga.”

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:53.520
I said, “Why did you say so?”

00:20:53.520 --> 00:21:00.360
She said, “You see, people relate to it
better, and they all came for the program.

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:05.830
And I gave the course and afterwards I returned
all the money, because you can’t take money.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:11.320
I played the tape” – where I said you
can’t pay for living things – “so I

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:12.550
returned the money.”

00:21:12.550 --> 00:21:18.530
But that fifty dollars, according to her,
pinpointed them to this.

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:24.170
I don’t think so it’s necessary, but she
made an experiment like that, that how people

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:26.210
stick on because they have paid for.

00:21:26.210 --> 00:21:32.470
Like we go to see a film and the film is horrid,
but because we have paid for we sit till we

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:35.790
are finished with the nonsense, you see – that’s
the nature.

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:40.150
But I don’t think in Sahaja Yoga we have
ever done that, but she said that she experimented

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:42.570
and it worked with people.

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:47.850
But I have better hopes.

00:21:47.850 --> 00:22:01.600
[Question: What is difference between Sahaja
Yoga and Raja Yoga?]

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:06.450
Sahaja Yoga is the complete integration of
all the yogas.

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:14.641
When the kundalini rises, then it has to be
held up at every center, you see: like it

00:22:14.641 --> 00:22:20.580
passes through the first, the second center,
then the third center, so the second center

00:22:20.580 --> 00:22:25.890
has to go into augmentation to the constriction,
so the kundalini doesn’t fall.

00:22:25.890 --> 00:22:30.370
Then it rises to the fourth center, then the
third center goes into augmentation.

00:22:30.370 --> 00:22:33.160
But it’s very quick, it’s very quick.

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:38.680
It happens as if when you start your car,
ignite, then all the machinery starts working

00:22:38.680 --> 00:22:41.130
automatically – in the same way it works.

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:49.480
But modern Raja Yoga is something very different:
what they do is to stop the chakras, without

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:51.270
starting the kundalini.

00:22:51.270 --> 00:22:58.730
They, even up to the point that the kundalini
when it passes through this center of Vishuddhi,

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:04.240
then your tongue is a little bit pulled inside
for stopping it from falling down.

00:23:04.240 --> 00:23:07.820
But you don’t feel it at all, you’ll see
that you’ll not feel anything of the kind;

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:14.000
because it goes like a jet in people, I’ve
seen, you just don’t feel all this thing.

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:19.470
So because they must have read about it, they
cut their tongues, the thread, and push back

00:23:19.470 --> 00:23:23.240
their tongues.

00:23:23.240 --> 00:23:28.900
And I was amazed that in Los Angeles there
are some doctors from India whose tongues

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:32.130
are wagging like dogs – they can’t speak.

00:23:32.130 --> 00:23:38.130
And this is what is absolutely wrong, that
when the car has not yet started, what’s

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:40.230
the use of moving the wheels?

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:43.670
You spoil the car – is artificial.

00:23:43.670 --> 00:23:45.770
Yoga cannot be artificial.

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:49.920
It has to be a living process, it has to be
spontaneous.

00:23:49.920 --> 00:23:54.150
“Yoga” means the union with the Divine.

00:23:54.150 --> 00:23:58.840
And I have seen people who have been to Raja
Yoga have suffered a lot.

00:23:58.840 --> 00:24:01.080
This is not Raja Yog.

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:02.930
Even Hatha Yoga is not there.

00:24:02.930 --> 00:24:09.890
“Ha” and “tha” is two nadis: is the
right-side nadi is the one which we call as

00:24:09.890 --> 00:24:15.471
the Surya Nadi, meaning the Sun Nadi, is “ha”;
and “tha” is the left-side nadi, which

00:24:15.471 --> 00:24:24.730
is the channel of pure, we can say it’s
the channel of desire, and is the power of

00:24:24.730 --> 00:24:26.020
desire.

00:24:26.020 --> 00:24:32.110
So these both things are to be worked out
simultaneously, so that you achieve the yoga.

00:24:32.110 --> 00:24:39.190
Now, Patanjali wrote about it long time back,
and the Patanjali Yoga just has ashtangas,

00:24:39.190 --> 00:24:44.550
means there are eight parts which is such
a big book, and eight parts to it, out of

00:24:44.550 --> 00:24:49.000
which a very wee, wee part of it is called
“yaman yamah”: out of that a very wee

00:24:49.000 --> 00:24:51.400
part is the exercises.

00:24:51.400 --> 00:24:56.050
And that too is to be applied only in case
when the kundalini starts, you know where

00:24:56.050 --> 00:25:01.190
it stops, and if there is any physical problem,
then only you are supposed to do.

00:25:01.190 --> 00:25:06.570
But these days I find the way people doing
Hatha Yoga is something like taking all the

00:25:06.570 --> 00:25:11.560
medicines from the medicine box like mad,
and they develop horrible problems because

00:25:11.560 --> 00:25:13.890
is only the right-side one.

00:25:13.890 --> 00:25:19.350
And some of the Hatha yogis are so hot-tempered
that if you have to approach them, one has

00:25:19.350 --> 00:25:21.550
to take a bargepole!

00:25:21.550 --> 00:25:29.730
We had one fellow called Mr. Brahmachari in
India who was a very well-known Hatha yogi,

00:25:29.730 --> 00:25:34.740
and he ended up in creating a big factory
of arms and ammunitions.

00:25:34.740 --> 00:25:39.720
I think it was too much for him inside the
arms and ammunitions, so he thought he’d

00:25:39.720 --> 00:25:42.270
better produce more of that.

00:25:42.270 --> 00:25:47.600
So it is something that is very one-sided,
and can create people who are very dry.

00:25:47.600 --> 00:25:53.790
Such people can go in for very bad married
lives; they might end up with very hot temper,

00:25:53.790 --> 00:26:01.760
bad livers, asthma, liver, and also the very
bad massive attacks of the heart could be

00:26:01.760 --> 00:26:03.980
there, because it’s only one side.

00:26:03.980 --> 00:26:10.590
You have to be in balance.

00:26:10.590 --> 00:26:16.830
[Inaudible question]

00:26:16.830 --> 00:26:26.190
Can you hear?

00:26:26.190 --> 00:26:41.730
[Question: If one has a problem in one particular
chakra, you don’t necessarily focus on that

00:26:41.730 --> 00:26:42.730
chakra, you must focus on the whole?]

00:26:42.730 --> 00:26:44.260
No, no question of focusing.

00:26:44.260 --> 00:26:48.270
You see, what happens that the kundalini rises,
and a person who is giving you realization

00:26:48.270 --> 00:26:49.270
can see clearly.

00:26:49.270 --> 00:26:54.850
You can even sometimes see this triangular
bone pulsating like a heart.

00:26:54.850 --> 00:26:58.850
And you can see the kundalini rising, and
you can see the movement of that energy.

00:26:58.850 --> 00:27:03.760
If it stops at a point – also you can feel
it on your fingertips, because of collective

00:27:03.760 --> 00:27:08.540
consciousness – then what you have to do
is to just to correct that center at that

00:27:08.540 --> 00:27:15.230
moment; then it rises.

00:27:15.230 --> 00:27:44.270
[Question: The colors of the chakras are basically
the colors of the spectrum?]

00:27:44.270 --> 00:27:45.270
Yes.

00:27:45.270 --> 00:27:46.270
That’s the color you have.

00:27:46.270 --> 00:28:00.440
It’s gold, you see, it is a golden color.

00:28:00.440 --> 00:28:07.851
[Question about Karma Yoga.]

00:28:07.851 --> 00:28:08.851
Karma Yoga?

00:28:08.851 --> 00:28:13.250
Now, Karma Yoga is a thing that is said that
whatever – this is a Shri Krishna’s preachings

00:28:13.250 --> 00:28:20.290
– that whatever karmas you do, you have
to do the karma, you have to do.

00:28:20.290 --> 00:28:26.690
But He is, He was a divine diplomat and He
knew that human beings are not straightforward,

00:28:26.690 --> 00:28:28.860
so He had to go round the way.

00:28:28.860 --> 00:28:35.070
But between the lines we must learn that first
thing He said, whatever karmas you do – I

00:28:35.070 --> 00:28:44.020
mean, He was not a modern shopkeeper, so first
He talked about gyana yoga, meaning “to

00:28:44.020 --> 00:28:45.510
know”: is “knowledge”, “know.”

00:28:45.510 --> 00:28:51.080
“Know” word comes from the Sanskrit word
“gn, gn” as we call it.

00:28:51.080 --> 00:28:58.360
And you know the early Christians were called
as Gnostics, meaning “who knew it on their

00:28:58.360 --> 00:28:59.679
central nervous system.”

00:28:59.679 --> 00:29:04.910
And from the same comes the word “vida”
from where the Veda is made, or “Buddha”

00:29:04.910 --> 00:29:12.600
means the bodha: is in the Buddhist style
they call it “bodha”, from where the word

00:29:12.600 --> 00:29:13.600
“Buddha” comes in.

00:29:13.600 --> 00:29:16.450
“Buddha” means “the one who is enlightened.”

00:29:16.450 --> 00:29:22.260
So you have to be enlightened on your central
nervous system, that is the thing is.

00:29:22.260 --> 00:29:25.250
So He said, first you seek the gyana.

00:29:25.250 --> 00:29:31.770
But then He talked about the karma to Arjuna;
He said that “you must do your karmas.”

00:29:31.770 --> 00:29:36.840
But the condition was that whatever karmas
you do, whatever work you do, you leave it

00:29:36.840 --> 00:29:40.070
at the feet of the Lord.

00:29:40.070 --> 00:29:45.920
That’s impossible, because if you are doing
something you always feel “I am doing it.”

00:29:45.920 --> 00:29:50.200
Even if you say “No, I leave it at the feet
of Lord” – is not so.

00:29:50.200 --> 00:29:53.330
Only after realization it happens.

00:29:53.330 --> 00:29:56.561
After realization you don’t say that “I’m
doing it.”

00:29:56.561 --> 00:30:01.170
It just works out this way – “now it’s
working, it’s going” – they talk in

00:30:01.170 --> 00:30:04.050
third line, third person, as if something
else is doing it.

00:30:04.050 --> 00:30:12.320
We are just as mediums or some sort of a instrument
in between, and it’s working; it’s not

00:30:12.320 --> 00:30:14.500
doing, it’s not happening.

00:30:14.500 --> 00:30:20.760
So after realization the karma becomes akarma,
means “non-action”: that you don’t think

00:30:20.760 --> 00:30:24.270
you are doing anything, it just works.

00:30:24.270 --> 00:30:27.910
And that’s why this Kriya Yoga is against
Sahaja Yoga.

00:30:27.910 --> 00:30:34.470
Sahaja Yoga is akriya, where there is no action;
just you think it’s happening, it’s there.

00:30:34.470 --> 00:30:37.500
You see it, you just, you are a witness of
the whole thing.

00:30:37.500 --> 00:30:42.750
So here, what happens that when the kundalini
rises, when she goes to the Agnya Chakra which

00:30:42.750 --> 00:30:49.950
represents, as you say, the third eye or whatever
you may call it – it is between the optic

00:30:49.950 --> 00:30:55.470
chiasma, and it looks after the pituitary
and the pineal body.

00:30:55.470 --> 00:31:00.690
And as a result we have developed two institutions
called ego and superego.

00:31:00.690 --> 00:31:04.694
The ego is the one which tells us “I have
done it.

00:31:04.694 --> 00:31:06.600
I am doing this.”

00:31:06.600 --> 00:31:15.049
Both these institutions are sucked in by the
enlightenment of this center and that’s

00:31:15.049 --> 00:31:21.520
how the thing opens out, and all your karmas
are sucked in, so there’s no problem of

00:31:21.520 --> 00:31:22.520
karmas.

00:31:22.520 --> 00:31:26.780
Only human beings think that they are doing
karmas; animals don’t.

00:31:26.780 --> 00:31:29.640
They have no sense of sin or anything.

00:31:29.640 --> 00:31:34.860
They are completely under the bondage of God,
so in Sanskrit they are called as “pashu”

00:31:34.860 --> 00:31:36.970
– means “under the bondage.”

00:31:36.970 --> 00:31:39.000
But we are the ones, we have got freedom.

00:31:39.000 --> 00:31:43.780
And that’s why we think we have done this
and we have done that; and we should not do

00:31:43.780 --> 00:31:45.970
this, we should not do that.

00:31:45.970 --> 00:31:52.380
But when the kundalini rises and she awakens
this center, then both these things are sucked

00:31:52.380 --> 00:31:53.660
in.

00:31:53.660 --> 00:32:00.960
And when they are sucked in, then you do not
do any karmas anymore, you just are in akarma.

00:32:00.960 --> 00:32:05.930
You do everything – I mean, I travel, you
know, such a lot and I have a family, and

00:32:05.930 --> 00:32:12.600
everything is there; but is just happening,
I am just seeing it, I am not doing anything

00:32:12.600 --> 00:32:13.600
as such.

00:32:13.600 --> 00:32:20.390
So when you are also awakened, there’s no
obligation, it’s just happening.

00:32:20.390 --> 00:32:31.190
It is here where we should understand that
this center is bestowed upon by the great

00:32:31.190 --> 00:32:32.920
life of Christ.

00:32:32.920 --> 00:32:39.100
Christ is there, and they said that He died
for our sins, died for our karmas – is a

00:32:39.100 --> 00:32:40.100
fact.

00:32:40.100 --> 00:32:48.150
Because when He is awakened these two institutions
are pulled in inside, and you get your kundalini

00:32:48.150 --> 00:32:50.990
out there – it opens out.

00:32:50.990 --> 00:32:58.700
And this bone which had been calcified opens
out, and the kundalini pierces through.

00:32:58.700 --> 00:33:06.830
And this is what it is, that He died for our
sins, but still the theory is extended that

00:33:06.830 --> 00:33:07.960
we must suffer.

00:33:07.960 --> 00:33:09.120
Why should we suffer?

00:33:09.120 --> 00:33:11.110
He has suffered for us already.

00:33:11.110 --> 00:33:16.440
And is already written by Thomas, who was
travelling to India via Egypt where he wrote

00:33:16.440 --> 00:33:21.290
the treatise, and he said that “Why should
we suffer?

00:33:21.290 --> 00:33:23.610
Christ has already suffered for us.”

00:33:23.610 --> 00:33:28.290
And he’s talked everything about Sahaja
Yoga; he said it is an experience of Self-realization,

00:33:28.290 --> 00:33:29.890
and everything.

00:33:29.890 --> 00:33:32.770
And that book now is out in England.

00:33:32.770 --> 00:33:38.790
After forty-eight years they could decode
the whole thing, which was found about forty-eight

00:33:38.790 --> 00:33:44.450
years back in Egypt and is out now, and is
beautiful – “Gnostics” is the name of

00:33:44.450 --> 00:33:46.090
the book.

00:33:46.090 --> 00:33:53.660
But is not so much appreciated by some of
the people, because this challenges the theories

00:33:53.660 --> 00:34:08.520
of sufferings and confessions and all this
nonsense.

00:34:08.520 --> 00:34:13.970
[Inaudible question]

00:34:13.970 --> 00:34:22.159
Me, or you?

00:34:22.159 --> 00:34:25.310
You cannot awaken yourself.

00:34:25.310 --> 00:34:32.260
You see, you have to have one enlightened
candle to enlighten another candle.

00:34:32.260 --> 00:34:37.480
This candle which is not enlightened cannot
enlighten itself.

00:34:37.480 --> 00:34:40.760
But there’s no obligation.

00:34:40.760 --> 00:34:46.980
But you can correct: once it is awakened you
can correct it, you can develop it.

00:34:46.980 --> 00:34:57.260
First only few hair-like strands of this energy
come up and open the fontanel bone area, and

00:34:57.260 --> 00:35:08.830
then this flow of ruh starts flowing on you
and it relaxes more of the centers, so more

00:35:08.830 --> 00:35:11.230
of these strands start coming up.

00:35:11.230 --> 00:35:22.650
So you can develop it at your will, by understanding
it, but you cannot enlighten yourself by yourself.

00:35:22.650 --> 00:35:47.840
[Inaudible question about the difficulty of
maintaining total awareness in meditation.]

00:35:47.840 --> 00:35:50.740
Because it’s not Sahaja meditation.

00:35:50.740 --> 00:35:53.980
All other meditations are artificial.

00:35:53.980 --> 00:35:57.260
You are in meditation when you are in Sahaj.

00:35:57.260 --> 00:36:02.930
Unless and until kundalini is awakened and
you are one with the divine Power, you’re

00:36:02.930 --> 00:36:07.480
still thinking all the time – how can you
stop thinking?

00:36:07.480 --> 00:36:12.051
There is one thought that rises and another
thought that falls off, again the another

00:36:12.051 --> 00:36:17.220
thought comes up and it falls off: it goes
on like this, and we are dancing on the cusps

00:36:17.220 --> 00:36:18.830
of these thoughts.

00:36:18.830 --> 00:36:24.050
In between the thought there’s a little
space called as “vilamba”, is the present

00:36:24.050 --> 00:36:31.680
– either we are in the past or in the future
– but that is only possible when the kundalini

00:36:31.680 --> 00:36:32.840
comes up.

00:36:32.840 --> 00:36:40.359
Then these thoughts become more lean and there’s
a bigger space left, and you remain in thoughtless

00:36:40.359 --> 00:36:45.050
awareness, and that is how it works out.

00:36:45.050 --> 00:36:52.500
That’s in the meditative mood you are all
the time, you don’t have to meditate because

00:36:52.500 --> 00:36:55.410
you’re in thoughtless awareness.

00:36:55.410 --> 00:37:03.380
As soon as you see something extremely beautiful,
extremely joy-giving, or a personality who

00:37:03.380 --> 00:37:09.920
is a realized soul, or anything that’s so
righteous and good, immediately you become

00:37:09.920 --> 00:37:12.630
thoughtless, immediately.

00:37:12.630 --> 00:37:17.700
It happens – you don’t have to do it,
you don’t have to be in meditation, you

00:37:17.700 --> 00:37:19.450
just become.

00:37:19.450 --> 00:37:26.020
I have seen these days there are many children
who are born who are realized souls, and just

00:37:26.020 --> 00:37:34.000
I’ve seen them sitting before Me, just – just
sitting, not moving, nothing, just in meditation.

00:37:34.000 --> 00:37:42.160
Your pupils dilate, and you start feeling
the cool breeze in your hand.

00:37:42.160 --> 00:37:48.600
Even if you meet someone it happens, if he’s
a realized soul.

00:37:48.600 --> 00:37:57.619
It’s very interesting, there was a poet
in India who was himself a tailor and he went

00:37:57.619 --> 00:38:02.750
to see somebody who was a potter – they
both were realized souls.

00:38:02.750 --> 00:38:09.660
And the potter was busy with his clay, you
see, trampling it with his feet.

00:38:09.660 --> 00:38:18.230
When he saw, this tailor saw this potter,
he looked at him, went into thoughtless awareness,

00:38:18.230 --> 00:38:25.950
and he said that – the poetry is so beautiful
– he says, “I came to see the nirguna”

00:38:25.950 --> 00:38:31.700
– meaning the formless, that is the vibrations
– “I came to see that, but that is in

00:38:31.700 --> 00:38:33.430
person here.”

00:38:33.430 --> 00:38:38.060
Such appreciation is not possible unless and
until you are a realized soul – you always

00:38:38.060 --> 00:38:40.200
see the defects of a person.

00:38:40.200 --> 00:38:46.090
But such a deep appreciation of another personality
is only possible when you are a realized soul,

00:38:46.090 --> 00:38:50.560
and then you are amazed how you are surrounded
by such beautiful people.

00:38:50.560 --> 00:38:58.070
We had this time at least three thousand people
for a seminar in India: no quarrels, no fights,

00:38:58.070 --> 00:39:04.820
all the time I hear about bouts of laughter,
joking, leg-pulling, all nice friendship going

00:39:04.820 --> 00:39:11.950
on; no problems of any kind, satisfied with
everything – so beautiful to see.

00:39:11.950 --> 00:39:17.700
Like I went to Russia, and the Germans came
to give realization to Russians, you know

00:39:17.700 --> 00:39:19.250
– that was too much.

00:39:19.250 --> 00:39:24.670
It was too much: I mean, I just felt so happy
about it, so happy, the tears started rolling

00:39:24.670 --> 00:39:33.900
in My eyes when I saw the Germans just embracing
all of them with such joy and purity, it was

00:39:33.900 --> 00:39:34.900
wonderful.

00:39:34.900 --> 00:39:39.120
In Sahaja Yoga Germans have become so gentle.

00:39:39.120 --> 00:39:53.750
The most gentle people are the Germans, extremely
gentle – can you believe that?

00:39:53.750 --> 00:40:11.450
(It’s a big question.)

00:40:11.450 --> 00:40:46.849
[Question about how long it takes to transform.]

00:40:46.849 --> 00:40:48.400
Depends on.

00:40:48.400 --> 00:40:51.330
It has transformed so many people instantly,
so many.

00:40:51.330 --> 00:40:54.580
Majority of people get transformed immediately.

00:40:54.580 --> 00:41:00.460
Some people do take time, I must say, but
transformation, the degree of transformation

00:41:00.460 --> 00:41:02.970
may vary from time to time.

00:41:02.970 --> 00:41:09.980
For example, in a place like London where
there are all hard nuts, I must tell you!

00:41:09.980 --> 00:41:15.340
– they’re very nice people, you see, very
scholarly, and coming from Cambridge and from

00:41:15.340 --> 00:41:20.600
Oxford and this and that – very skeptical,
doesn’t matter.

00:41:20.600 --> 00:41:27.880
These people had taken to drugs: imagine,
very well-educated, some professors, some

00:41:27.880 --> 00:41:36.670
doctors had taken to drugs and were alcoholics;
absolutely they were lost people, I would

00:41:36.670 --> 00:41:37.670
say.

00:41:37.670 --> 00:41:45.920
And when they got their realization, overnight
they gave up – drinking, alcoholism.

00:41:45.920 --> 00:41:48.340
I was amazed at their own depths.

00:41:48.340 --> 00:42:00.780
The way they trust their own depth, they just
gave up – it’s very surprising.

00:42:00.780 --> 00:42:04.770
So you cannot say the degree, but one should
never have diffidence about it.

00:42:04.770 --> 00:42:10.440
It all works out, the transformation works
out, and in collectivity it works out much

00:42:10.440 --> 00:42:11.640
better.

00:42:11.640 --> 00:42:16.470
If you get out of the collectivity it is like
a nail which is cut out of the hand, you see,

00:42:16.470 --> 00:42:22.590
because you are all part and parcel of the
whole, of one being, and you are awakened;

00:42:22.590 --> 00:42:28.450
but if you get out of that body, then again
there’s a problem.

00:42:28.450 --> 00:42:31.600
So it takes time for such people.

00:42:31.600 --> 00:42:37.290
And also for people who are sick, maybe more
time, maybe some people who are mentally worse.

00:42:37.290 --> 00:42:41.180
Some people are, as I said, hard nuts can
break very fast.

00:42:41.180 --> 00:42:46.670
You can say I have had all kinds of experiences.

00:42:46.670 --> 00:42:51.040
And I always say that Sahaja Yoga is a big
joke, I tell you, because you see people,

00:42:51.040 --> 00:42:55.270
just you see them so aggressive, so funny.

00:42:55.270 --> 00:43:00.000
Like one fellow came all drunk to the program,
and he was so aggressive with Me and he was

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:01.410
about to hit Me.

00:43:01.410 --> 00:43:02.820
Then they took him out.

00:43:02.820 --> 00:43:05.410
I said, “All right, come and see Me tomorrow.”

00:43:05.410 --> 00:43:08.510
Then they put the address in his pocket.

00:43:08.510 --> 00:43:11.270
Next day he was there, and today he’s a
very good engineer, electrical engineer he

00:43:11.270 --> 00:43:12.270
is; he’s very good.

00:43:12.270 --> 00:43:26.090
[Question: Can You explain the process You
use to raise the kundalini?]

00:43:26.090 --> 00:43:36.900
All right, that I’m going to do.

00:43:36.900 --> 00:43:38.500
That’s a very good question.

00:43:38.500 --> 00:43:45.180
Yes, that I will do.

00:43:45.180 --> 00:44:07.220
[Question: Could You give some advice on how
to be non-judgmental – not to judge others?]

00:44:07.220 --> 00:44:14.750
Yes, people start judging others because they
don’t know themselves.

00:44:14.750 --> 00:44:20.560
Once you know yourself, start judging yourself
first of all.

00:44:20.560 --> 00:44:23.430
This is the Last Judgment, where you judge
yourself.

00:44:23.430 --> 00:44:31.040
Is written in Koran that “your hands will
speak, and they will give witness against

00:44:31.040 --> 00:44:32.040
you.”

00:44:32.040 --> 00:44:35.450
And you get frightened about yourself, “Oh
God, I’ve got this, and …” Like the

00:44:35.450 --> 00:44:38.700
other day somebody came, “Mother, please,
please solve my problem.”

00:44:38.700 --> 00:44:39.700
I said, “What has happened?”

00:44:39.700 --> 00:44:44.070
“My Agnya is horrible” – means “I
am very egoistical.”

00:44:44.070 --> 00:44:49.760
So the attention goes to yourself and you
start correcting yourself, and you look at

00:44:49.760 --> 00:44:56.200
the good points of others.

00:44:56.200 --> 00:45:02.320
And if somebody says to you that such a chakra
is catching, you thank that person, you’re

00:45:02.320 --> 00:45:04.420
happy, because his interest is benevolence.

00:45:04.420 --> 00:45:09.770
He is not trying to judge you, but is benevolence
if he finds it.

00:45:09.770 --> 00:45:15.250
But normally you find yourself about yourself,
there’s no need to talk about it; just find

00:45:15.250 --> 00:45:16.250
out yourself.

00:45:16.250 --> 00:45:25.440
[Question: Mother, is it possible that once
you become realized, you can fall back?]

00:45:25.440 --> 00:45:30.820
Yes, it is, sometimes, you know.

00:45:30.820 --> 00:45:34.640
Because at the time of the growth, is the
parable of Christ, you see, that He said that

00:45:34.640 --> 00:45:40.369
some seeds fell on the marshy ground – they
sprouted, but did not grow.

00:45:40.369 --> 00:45:46.010
So that, it’s possible because depends on
the superficial temperament of a person, may

00:45:46.010 --> 00:45:47.130
be possible.

00:45:47.130 --> 00:45:53.650
But so far I have seen many people who went
out of the Sahaja Yoga again are back – again

00:45:53.650 --> 00:45:54.650
back, very much.

00:45:54.650 --> 00:46:00.000
The other day we saw them in Melbourne: so
many are back again, and they were very sorry

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:05.380
that they went out, they want to come back
– because so much of enjoyment, you see.

00:46:05.380 --> 00:46:12.350
When you have tasted the nectar, the ambrose,
then you don’t want to taste something else.

00:46:12.350 --> 00:46:17.330
But if you try again because of your habits
or something, again you want to come back,

00:46:17.330 --> 00:46:18.500
because you remember that experience.

00:46:18.500 --> 00:46:23.730
The Sahaja Yoga moves like that.

00:46:23.730 --> 00:46:25.360
Many people come in first.

00:46:25.360 --> 00:46:27.360
Then a few people come for follow-on.

00:46:27.360 --> 00:46:35.090
Then again some people come in, and some more
come in – like that it goes on filling the

00:46:35.090 --> 00:46:36.090
cup.

00:46:36.090 --> 00:46:41.270
But follow-on people will be less: depends
on the depth of a person how much he has touched

00:46:41.270 --> 00:46:45.359
it, or how much he has understood his own
value of his realization.

00:46:45.359 --> 00:46:51.310
They’ll all come, but some people won’t;
but then they start coming back.

00:46:51.310 --> 00:46:52.490
And how it grows that way.

00:46:52.490 --> 00:46:56.849
Now I don’t know – if you ask Me, I don’t
know how many there are in this whole world,

00:46:56.849 --> 00:46:57.849
Sahaja yogis.

00:46:57.849 --> 00:47:01.340
I can only make them out whenever I see them,
they are Sahaja yogis, that’s all.

00:47:01.340 --> 00:47:13.480
You also have one method: we take the photograph
of a person after realization and put the

00:47:13.480 --> 00:47:19.869
name and the time of realization, the date
of birth, and put it on these plastic albums

00:47:19.869 --> 00:47:26.620
and I see them, all of them, and that’s
how I know.

00:47:26.620 --> 00:47:33.340
It’s a beautiful rapport, and love and friendship,
understanding and protection.

00:47:33.340 --> 00:47:38.020
No one wants to leave it normally; but if
they want, they’re free – there’s no

00:47:38.020 --> 00:47:39.020
force.

00:47:39.020 --> 00:47:41.760
You cannot force it, that’s the main point.

00:47:41.760 --> 00:47:45.980
Even if you don’t want Sahaja Yoga I cannot
force it, if you don’t want pure knowledge

00:47:45.980 --> 00:47:50.101
I cannot force it, if you don’t want Self-realization,
I cannot force it.

00:47:50.101 --> 00:47:53.500
It cannot be forced.

00:47:53.500 --> 00:48:05.490
It’s not conversion, it is transformation.

00:48:05.490 --> 00:48:13.520
Now should we have?

00:48:13.520 --> 00:48:19.550
All right.

00:48:19.550 --> 00:48:22.540
Again I repeat that it cannot be forced.

00:48:22.540 --> 00:48:30.000
So those who do not want to have it, have
to leave the hall please, that would be very

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:31.880
kind of them.

00:48:31.880 --> 00:48:33.089
It takes only ten minutes.

00:48:33.089 --> 00:48:40.570
There’s no danger, nothing of the kind;
and most of you will feel it, I’m sure,

00:48:40.570 --> 00:48:42.480
the all-pervading Power.

00:48:42.480 --> 00:48:48.210
Now first thing you feel is the cool breeze
out of your fontanel bone area, and then also

00:48:48.210 --> 00:48:51.700
you feel the cool breeze on your fingertips.

00:48:51.700 --> 00:48:56.060
Sometimes you might feel heat, if you have
a liver problem or something, or if you have

00:48:56.060 --> 00:48:58.390
not forgiven people.

00:48:58.390 --> 00:49:02.380
But there are two conditions for Sahaja Yoga.

00:49:02.380 --> 00:49:08.930
One of them is that you have to forget the
past – you have to forgive yourself completely,

00:49:08.930 --> 00:49:14.050
and not to feel guilty at all.

00:49:14.050 --> 00:49:18.750
No guilt, because with the guilt you catch
on this center and which is very dangerous

00:49:18.750 --> 00:49:25.050
also – I’ll tell about it later when we
go on with it – but please do not feel guilty.

00:49:25.050 --> 00:49:31.790
At this moment in the present you are all
great people who are here to get your realization,

00:49:31.790 --> 00:49:39.540
you are seekers of truth, and forget about
anything that makes you feel guilty.

00:49:39.540 --> 00:49:43.270
That’s one condition.

00:49:43.270 --> 00:49:49.430
That means you should be pleasantly placed
towards yourself – as we say in Sanskrit,

00:49:49.430 --> 00:49:54.240
“prasannajit” – because you are going
to enter into the Kingdom of God, and you

00:49:54.240 --> 00:49:57.410
should be very happy to do that.

00:49:57.410 --> 00:50:03.190
Now, the second condition is that you have
to forgive everyone.

00:50:03.190 --> 00:50:08.560
Some people say it’s very difficult to forgive,
but if you forgive or don’t forgive, it’s

00:50:08.560 --> 00:50:09.560
a myth.

00:50:09.560 --> 00:50:10.880
What do you do?

00:50:10.880 --> 00:50:11.880
Nothing.

00:50:11.880 --> 00:50:14.680
But if you don’t forgive, then you play
into wrong hands.

00:50:14.680 --> 00:50:20.080
So at this moment just say, just in general;
not to remember all of them who have troubled

00:50:20.080 --> 00:50:24.160
you, or who have made you miserable or made
you unhappy.

00:50:24.160 --> 00:50:27.240
Just say “I forgive every one of them”
– that’s all.

00:50:27.240 --> 00:50:32.339
These two conditions you have to follow, which
is very simple: it’s just to say in your

00:50:32.339 --> 00:50:39.150
heart that “I am not guilty at all” and
that “I forgive everyone.”

00:50:39.150 --> 00:50:40.820
So now we work it out.

00:50:40.820 --> 00:50:51.570
Now, we may have take out our shoes, because
the shoes are not an obstruction but better

00:50:51.570 --> 00:51:02.849
to take some help from the Mother Earth, it
is important.

00:51:02.849 --> 00:51:07.340
And trust yourself, believe in yourself, have
self-confidence.

00:51:07.340 --> 00:51:17.560
Don’t think that you can’t get it – all
of you can get it, you’re quite capable.

00:51:17.560 --> 00:51:30.500
Now, I’ll show you first how to nourish
your own centers and to raise your kundalini.

00:51:30.500 --> 00:51:37.930
First, you keep your eyes open and see for
yourself, and later on we have to close our

00:51:37.930 --> 00:51:40.780
eyes to go into the process – it’s very
simple.

00:51:40.780 --> 00:51:47.280
So first of all, the left hand is towards
Me, representing the desire to get Self-realization,

00:51:47.280 --> 00:51:55.380
just like this: ordinary way of sitting, not
too much of bending or too much of straight.

00:51:55.380 --> 00:52:01.880
Just ordinary way we sit, comfortably, and
put both the feet apart from each other because

00:52:01.880 --> 00:52:03.420
these are two powers.

00:52:03.420 --> 00:52:09.780
So just to keep them on the ground apart from
each other, and the left hand towards Me.

00:52:09.780 --> 00:52:15.380
Now the right hand is the one which does the
action to nourish your centers.

00:52:15.380 --> 00:52:22.100
So first we put our right hand on our heart,
while we keep the left hand all the time steady

00:52:22.100 --> 00:52:23.100
like that.

00:52:23.100 --> 00:52:26.360
Now, in the heart resides the spirit.

00:52:26.360 --> 00:52:36.840
In the heart resides the spirit, and the first
thing is to recognize that it resides in our

00:52:36.840 --> 00:52:37.840
heart.

00:52:37.840 --> 00:52:41.430
We have to open our heart for that.

00:52:41.430 --> 00:52:48.810
Then we take down our hand to the upper portion
of our abdomen, which is the center of your

00:52:48.810 --> 00:52:50.040
mastery.

00:52:50.040 --> 00:52:56.070
So many great masters, as we call them Satgurus,
have created this special center for us.

00:52:56.070 --> 00:53:01.460
By enlightening it, you become the master
and you can give realizations to others.

00:53:01.460 --> 00:53:07.650
Because if you are the spirit, the light of
spirit guides you, so you become your own

00:53:07.650 --> 00:53:10.880
guru, you become your own master.

00:53:10.880 --> 00:53:17.290
Then is the center which is in the lower portion
of your abdomen on the left-hand side.

00:53:17.290 --> 00:53:20.060
We work only on the left-hand side.

00:53:20.060 --> 00:53:29.010
This is the very important center which manifests
on your central nervous system the pure knowledge,

00:53:29.010 --> 00:53:42.830
by which you can feel the all-pervading Power
and you can know all the laws that are divine.

00:53:42.830 --> 00:53:46.740
Then you take back your hand on the upper
portion of your abdomen again, on the left-hand

00:53:46.740 --> 00:53:50.920
side, and press it hard.

00:53:50.920 --> 00:53:56.720
And then you take your right hand again on
your heart.

00:53:56.720 --> 00:54:05.920
Then, in the corner of your shoulder and your
neck, like this, from this side, and turn

00:54:05.920 --> 00:54:10.960
your head to your right fully so that you
can push back your …. Now this is the center

00:54:10.960 --> 00:54:14.960
mostly catching, is the center where we feel
guilty.

00:54:14.960 --> 00:54:22.270
It’s a very dangerous one because when it
catches you get spondylitis, you get so many

00:54:22.270 --> 00:54:27.790
other troubles like angina, and the whole
system becomes very lethargic.

00:54:27.790 --> 00:54:38.089
So please put this right hand across and press
it hard onto the spinal cord on the left-hand

00:54:38.089 --> 00:54:40.980
side.

00:54:40.980 --> 00:54:51.500
Now, take your right hand on your forehead
across like this and put down your head.

00:54:51.500 --> 00:54:57.560
Put down your head and press it on both the
sides, your forehead, as we do it when we

00:54:57.560 --> 00:55:00.910
have headaches, just like this.

00:55:00.910 --> 00:55:05.980
This is the center for forgiving others.

00:55:05.980 --> 00:55:11.560
Now you take back your right hand on the back
side of your head, and push back your head

00:55:11.560 --> 00:55:20.180
slowly on it as far as you can take it, balancing
on the hand like that.

00:55:20.180 --> 00:55:30.640
Now here you have to ask for forgiveness from
the Divine, if knowingly or unknowingly you

00:55:30.640 --> 00:55:36.240
have done some mistakes – but without feeling
guilty, without counting the mistakes, without

00:55:36.240 --> 00:55:40.260
thinking about them – for your satisfaction
only.

00:55:40.260 --> 00:55:45.710
Now you have to stretch your hand, right hand
fully, stretch your palm.

00:55:45.710 --> 00:55:54.210
And the center of your palm, you have to put
it on top of your fontanel bone area here

00:55:54.210 --> 00:55:57.240
and press back your fingers.

00:55:57.240 --> 00:56:05.540
Press them back, stretch them back, so that
there’s a nice pressure on your fontanel

00:56:05.540 --> 00:56:07.220
bone area.

00:56:07.220 --> 00:56:13.680
And here you have to move your scalp very
slowly clockwise, seven times – the scalp,

00:56:13.680 --> 00:56:15.730
not the hand, the scalp has to move.

00:56:15.730 --> 00:56:16.970
This is very important.

00:56:16.970 --> 00:56:25.260
So stretch back your fingers, stretch them
back so the pressure is all right.

00:56:25.260 --> 00:56:32.480
And now .…

00:56:32.480 --> 00:56:47.710
Hmm, that’s all we have to do, not much.

00:56:47.710 --> 00:56:56.820
Now we can close our eyes, both the feet apart
from each other, left hand like this, and

00:56:56.820 --> 00:57:01.920
the right hand is to be used for nourishing
our centers on the left-hand side.

00:57:01.920 --> 00:57:05.720
Please close your eyes and don’t open them
till I tell you.

00:57:05.720 --> 00:57:13.520
You can take out your spectacles also: there’s
no need to have spectacles when you have closed

00:57:13.520 --> 00:57:19.160
your eyes, and also sometimes it helps your
eyesight.

00:57:19.160 --> 00:57:23.960
So now, please close your eyes.

00:57:23.960 --> 00:57:31.690
Put your right hand on your heart, left hand
towards Me.

00:57:31.690 --> 00:57:39.980
Here you have to ask a very important question,
three times to Me, in your heart.

00:57:39.980 --> 00:57:45.430
As you ask a computer, you have to ask a question
– you can call Me “Shri Mataji” or you

00:57:45.430 --> 00:57:49.180
can call Me “Mother” – “Mother, am
I the spirit?

00:57:49.180 --> 00:57:51.589
Mother, am I the spirit?”

00:57:51.589 --> 00:57:55.099
Ask this question three times.

00:57:55.099 --> 00:58:04.710
Please keep your eyes shut.

00:58:04.710 --> 00:58:18.410
Now, if you are the spirit, you are your guide,
you are your guru.

00:58:18.410 --> 00:58:25.100
So now please take down this right hand on
the upper portion of your abdomen on the left-hand

00:58:25.100 --> 00:58:35.730
side, and here you ask Me another question
in your heart, with full confidence, “Mother,

00:58:35.730 --> 00:58:38.050
am I my own master?

00:58:38.050 --> 00:58:40.619
Mother, am I my own master?”

00:58:40.619 --> 00:58:53.260
Ask this question three times.

00:58:53.260 --> 00:59:08.940
Now, take down your right hand in the lower
portion of your abdomen.

00:59:08.940 --> 00:59:15.180
Here is the center of pure knowledge.

00:59:15.180 --> 00:59:23.270
And as I told you, it cannot be forced on
you – I respect your freedom.

00:59:23.270 --> 00:59:30.770
So here you have to say six times in your
heart, because this center has got six petals.

00:59:30.770 --> 00:59:39.980
You have to say, “Mother, please give me
pure knowledge” – I cannot force it on

00:59:39.980 --> 00:59:42.440
you.

00:59:42.440 --> 00:59:47.369
Six times.

00:59:47.369 --> 00:59:55.270
As soon as you start saying this, the kundalini
starts rising.

00:59:55.270 --> 01:00:10.030
And now we have to nourish our centers, upper
centers, with our self-confidence.

01:00:10.030 --> 01:00:24.650
So now raise your right hand onto the upper
portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side,

01:00:24.650 --> 01:00:35.920
and here you have to say with full confidence
in yourself, to open this center, “Mother,

01:00:35.920 --> 01:00:38.250
I am my own master.”

01:00:38.250 --> 01:00:39.860
Say it ten times, please.

01:00:39.860 --> 01:00:41.720
“Mother, I am my own master.”

01:00:41.720 --> 01:00:44.270
Say it with full confidence.

01:00:44.270 --> 01:01:03.910
Now, the greatest truth about you is that
you are not this body, you are not this mind,

01:01:03.910 --> 01:01:11.500
you are not these emotions, nor you are this
ego or these thoughts; but you are pure spirit.

01:01:11.500 --> 01:01:17.730
This is the greatest truth.

01:01:17.730 --> 01:01:28.339
So now raise your right hand to your heart
and say with full confidence, with full confidence

01:01:28.339 --> 01:01:36.750
you have to say, “Mother, I am the spirit.”

01:01:36.750 --> 01:01:38.670
Say it twelve times, please.

01:01:38.670 --> 01:01:41.580
“Mother, I am the spirit.”

01:01:41.580 --> 01:01:53.290
Twelve times, with full confidence.

01:01:53.290 --> 01:02:12.250
Now, I have already told you that you need
not have guilt.

01:02:12.250 --> 01:02:22.730
The all-pervading Power is the ocean of love
and bliss, it is the ocean of knowledge and

01:02:22.730 --> 01:02:28.970
joy, but above all it is the ocean of forgiveness.

01:02:28.970 --> 01:02:34.220
So you cannot commit any mistakes that cannot
be dissolved by the power of this great ocean

01:02:34.220 --> 01:02:36.200
of forgiveness.

01:02:36.200 --> 01:02:44.050
So now raise your right hand in the corner
of your neck and your shoulder and place it

01:02:44.050 --> 01:02:48.520
behind as much as possible, from the front
side – not from the back side, but from

01:02:48.520 --> 01:02:56.180
the front side – and turn your head towards
the right.

01:02:56.180 --> 01:03:06.250
Here you have to say, again with full confidence,
sixteen times because there are sixteen petals

01:03:06.250 --> 01:03:29.150
to this, “Mother, I am not guilty at all.”

01:03:29.150 --> 01:03:35.829
As I have told you that we have to forgive
everyone, and many people think that it’s

01:03:35.829 --> 01:03:37.390
difficult to forgive.

01:03:37.390 --> 01:03:42.590
Whether you forgive or you don’t forgive,
you don’t do anything; but we are not to

01:03:42.590 --> 01:03:48.380
play into wrong hands by not forgiving, which
is a myth, absolute myth.

01:03:48.380 --> 01:03:56.560
So now raise your right hand and put it on
your forehead across, bend your head fully

01:03:56.560 --> 01:03:58.569
and press it hard.

01:03:58.569 --> 01:04:05.170
And here from your heart, say “Mother, I
forgive everyone.”

01:04:05.170 --> 01:04:08.390
You don’t have to think how many people
you have to forgive, whom you have to forgive,

01:04:08.390 --> 01:04:13.650
for what you have to forgive, but just say,
“Mother, I forgive everyone.”

01:04:13.650 --> 01:04:22.099
From your heart, not how many times; it has
to come from your heart.

01:04:22.099 --> 01:04:23.099
This is very important.

01:04:23.099 --> 01:04:27.740
If you don’t forgive, the kundalini won’t
just pass through: this is the very important

01:04:27.740 --> 01:04:31.650
center of Agnya, which is a very constricted
one normally.

01:04:31.650 --> 01:04:41.490
So please say it from your heart, “Mother,
I forgive everyone.”

01:04:41.490 --> 01:04:51.420
Don’t say “I can’t” – please don’t
say that.

01:04:51.420 --> 01:05:01.800
Now take your hand on the back side of your
head, and push back your head on it as far

01:05:01.800 --> 01:05:08.570
as you could take it, and let it rest on your
hand.

01:05:08.570 --> 01:05:12.859
Here you have to ask for forgiveness from
Divine.

01:05:12.859 --> 01:05:18.630
But you are not to think of the mistakes you
have committed or whatever wrongs you have

01:05:18.630 --> 01:05:25.170
done, or to count them or to think of the
people, but just in general for your own satisfaction

01:05:25.170 --> 01:05:35.170
you have to say, without feeling guilty – from
your heart, not how many times – “Oh Divine,

01:05:35.170 --> 01:05:46.440
please forgive me if I have done, knowingly
or unknowingly, anything wrong.”

01:05:46.440 --> 01:06:03.650
Now, stretch your hand, stretch your palm.

01:06:03.650 --> 01:06:12.030
Now put your hand or your palm, the center
of your palm, on top of the fontanel bone

01:06:12.030 --> 01:06:19.089
area and now stretch your fingers backwards
– this is very important.

01:06:19.089 --> 01:06:26.960
Stretch them as much as you can, so that there’s
a nice pressure on your fontanel bone area.

01:06:26.960 --> 01:06:33.740
And you have to move it, the scalp, seven
times clockwise very, very slowly.

01:06:33.740 --> 01:06:44.349
But here again I cannot cross over your freedom
– you have to ask for Self-realization.

01:06:44.349 --> 01:06:48.339
So please say seven times, “Mother, please
give me Self-realization.”

01:06:48.339 --> 01:07:03.130
Please ask for it seven times, when you are
moving your hand slowly seven times.

01:07:03.130 --> 01:07:42.640
[Shri Mataji blows into microphone.]

01:07:42.640 --> 01:07:46.581
Now please take down your hands, and open
your eyes.

01:07:46.581 --> 01:07:51.100
You can put on your glasses if you want to.

01:07:51.100 --> 01:08:00.640
Now put your right hand towards Me now like
this, a little lifted up, and bend your head.

01:08:00.640 --> 01:08:07.849
And see for yourself, with the left hand on
top of the fontanel bone, see for yourself

01:08:07.849 --> 01:08:13.970
– bending your head – see for yourself
if there’s a cool breeze coming out of your

01:08:13.970 --> 01:08:15.720
fontanel bone area.

01:08:15.720 --> 01:08:22.719
You can lift the hand a little higher, sometimes
it can be much higher, but don’t touch your

01:08:22.719 --> 01:08:23.719
head.

01:08:23.719 --> 01:08:31.130
Should be above, at least three to four inches
minimum to begin with, and then you’ll feel

01:08:31.130 --> 01:08:32.619
the cool breeze.

01:08:32.619 --> 01:08:37.069
Just move your hand – bend your head is
the best way.

01:08:37.069 --> 01:08:44.969
Now put the left hand towards Me like this,
and now bend your head and see with your right

01:08:44.969 --> 01:08:51.079
hand if there’s a cool breeze coming out
of your fontanel bone area.

01:08:51.079 --> 01:08:55.709
There could be hot air also coming, doesn’t
matter.

01:08:55.709 --> 01:09:01.949
Don’t doubt it, and don’t think it’s
air conditioning after all!

01:09:01.949 --> 01:09:07.929
It cannot be coming out of your head, isn’t
it?

01:09:07.929 --> 01:09:16.079
Now again put the right hand towards Me, keep
your head bent, and also now see for yourself

01:09:16.079 --> 01:09:27.469
if you can feel the cool breeze coming out
of your head with the left hand.

01:09:27.469 --> 01:09:40.979
Now, you can lift your both the hands towards
the roof like this, and bend back your head.

01:09:40.979 --> 01:09:47.109
And here you have to ask a question three
times, “Mother, is this the cool breeze

01:09:47.109 --> 01:09:48.849
of the Holy Ghost?

01:09:48.849 --> 01:09:51.679
Mother, is this the ruh?

01:09:51.679 --> 01:09:54.539
Mother, is this the Paramachaitanya?

01:09:54.539 --> 01:09:59.479
Mother, is this the all-pervading Power of
God’s love?”

01:09:59.479 --> 01:10:09.659
Ask any one of these questions, three times.

01:10:09.659 --> 01:10:21.940
Now put down your hands, and just watch Me
without thinking – you can do it.

01:10:21.940 --> 01:10:31.179
Now, those who have felt the cool breeze out
of their fontanel bone or on their fingertips

01:10:31.179 --> 01:10:40.880
– even hot air is all right – please raise
both your hands.

01:10:40.880 --> 01:10:43.420
Oh, most of you – yes!

01:10:43.420 --> 01:10:45.139
May God bless you.

01:10:45.139 --> 01:10:49.239
You’re all saints now, I bow to all of you.

01:10:49.239 --> 01:10:51.199
May God bless you.

01:10:51.199 --> 01:10:56.079
So nice to see – some of you did not feel
it, doesn’t matter; don’t get disappointed.

01:10:56.079 --> 01:11:01.530
We have a very nice center, and some of you
who have not felt can come round, and some

01:11:01.530 --> 01:11:06.409
of the Sahaja yogis can work it out for you;
maybe there’s some sort of an obstruction

01:11:06.409 --> 01:11:07.409
somewhere.

01:11:07.409 --> 01:11:12.730
So don’t feel nervous about it: it will
all work out, no problem.

01:11:12.730 --> 01:11:15.539
So may God bless you.

01:11:15.539 --> 01:11:16.539
If you want you can come and shake hands with
Me, because I’ll be going away tomorrow.

01:11:16.539 --> 01:11:17.539
I could move forward a little bit.

01:11:17.539 --> 01:11:18.539
Why not turn the lights to them now?

01:11:18.539 --> 01:11:19.539
…. All the lights are always like this?

01:11:19.539 --> 01:11:20.539
…. Come along, come along.

01:11:20.539 --> 01:11:21.539
I’d love to meet you.

01:11:21.539 --> 01:11:22.539
So, we’re going to work it out now.

01:11:22.539 --> 01:11:23.539
But you did feel it?

01:11:23.539 --> 01:11:24.539
Hot, you did, all right?

01:11:24.539 --> 01:11:25.539
That’s all right, now you’d better forgive.

01:11:25.539 --> 01:11:26.539
That’s very important.

01:11:26.539 --> 01:11:27.539
Better forgive.

01:11:27.539 --> 01:11:28.539
You can help your friend in the hospital also.

01:11:28.539 --> 01:11:29.539
Now better?

01:11:29.539 --> 01:11:30.539
You see, because, because you have not forgiven.

01:11:30.539 --> 01:11:31.539
Now better?

01:11:31.539 --> 01:11:32.539
Forgive, forgive, forgive.

01:11:32.539 --> 01:11:33.539
You must forgive, it’s very important to
forgive.

01:11:33.539 --> 01:11:34.539
… Just forgive, forgive, forgive, forgive.

01:11:34.539 --> 01:11:35.539
All right?

01:11:35.539 --> 01:11:36.539
Still hot?

01:11:36.539 --> 01:11:37.539
You didn’t forgive.

01:11:37.539 --> 01:11:38.539
Forgive, again.

01:11:38.539 --> 01:11:39.539
Just say, “Mother, I forgive everyone”
– just forgive.

01:11:39.539 --> 01:11:40.539
What a weapon it is, just to forgive; it’s
such a weapon, such a protection …. Still

01:11:40.539 --> 01:11:41.539
hot?

01:11:41.539 --> 01:11:42.539
Better?

01:11:42.539 --> 01:11:43.539
Work it out, all right?

01:11:43.539 --> 01:11:59.599
You can come and see these people .…

